#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI, i ngā wāhi katoa"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "Tētahi tauira tohu kua whakatauhia, kua hurihia hei stylesheets, here anga, waehere taketake, me ngā raraunga mō ngā taputapu hoahoa."

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Tīmatanga"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "Mahere mō ngā mōkī"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Tohu API"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Tohu CSS"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Kotahi te puna pono"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Ka pānuitia e ngā mōkī katoa te IR o ngā tohu kua whakatauhia. Mēnā ka huri tētahi tohu ki te puna matua, ka pā tonu aua huri ki CSS, SCSS, waehere taketake, me Figma."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Whakamahia te mōkī iti rawa"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Tāuta noa @pantoken/css mō tētahi stylesheet, @pantoken/react mō ngā hooks me ngā icons, rānei he preset bundler mō Tailwind, Panda, rānei MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Hangaia mō ngā tūāpapa katoa"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Whakarewa `pantoken generate` kia whakaputa Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, me ētahi atu. Ngā tohu kotahi — i ia reo o ia pūnaha."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Kāore he here ki te puna matua"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Ka tukuna ngā tohu hei JSON vendored tūwhera, nō reira kāore `npm i` e rapu i tētahi puna e wātea ana anake i GitHub. Ka taea te whakaputa, kua noho semver, ā, he pai mō te whakamahi tuimotu (offline)."
